Package: libpqmagic-std0
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Post-Quantum Cryptography library (PQMagic-std, SM3 build)
 PQMagic implements the NIST post-quantum standards FIPS 203/204/205
 (ML-KEM, ML-DSA, SLH-DSA) together with the Aigis-enc, Aigis-sig and
 SPHINCS-Alpha algorithms.
 .
 This package contains the shared library built with the SM3 hash
 component (Chinese national standard, GB/T 32905-2016).

Package: libpqmagic-std-dev
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Section: libdevel
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 libpqmagic-std0 (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Development files for PQMagic
 Headers needed to build software against the PQMagic post-quantum
 cryptography library.
